		{"id":"d79022fd5ca9c83f","type":"file","file":"数学/数学分析/导数/导数的几何意义.md","x":-262,"y":340,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"9e75015203bc06aa","text":"> [!info] 定义（图像中的切线）\n> $f(x_{0})$ 的 $x_{0}$ 在[[区间#邻域|邻域]]内有定义，在 $x_{0}$ 取增量 $\\Delta x$，$\\Delta y=f(x+\\Delta x)-x_{0}$，有：$$f'(x)=\\lim_{ \\Delta x \\to 0 } \\frac{\\Delta y}{\\Delta x}=\\lim_{ \\Delta x \\to 0 } \\frac{f(x_{0}-\\Delta x)-f(x_{0})}{\\Delta x}$$","type":"text","x":138,"y":-120,"width":402,"height":211},
		{"id":"2d2e00ff26038c43","text":"$$\nf'(x_{0})=\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to 0}\\frac{\\Delta y}{\\Delta x}=f'(x)=\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to 0}\\frac{f(x_0+\\Delta x)-f(x_0)}{\\Delta x}\n$$","type":"text","x":138,"y":120,"width":402,"height":80},
		{"id":"df8bcbe21c190694","text":"### [[导数]]\n\n\n[[函数的极限]]：瞬时变化率","type":"text","x":-173,"y":-40,"width":222,"height":112},
		{"id":"f3ac1c89725cb8a3","text":"平均变化率","type":"text","x":-125,"y":-160,"width":126,"height":27},
		{"id":"eadb171d52f23bf3","text":"思想：以直代曲","type":"text","x":-141,"y":178,"width":158,"height":27}
	]
